    description: { en: "BaZi, or Four Pillars of Destiny, is an ancient Chinese astrology system that maps your birth moment into a precise energy blueprint. Learn how it works.", zh: "BaZi, or Four Pillars of Destiny, is an ancient Chinese astrology system that maps your birth moment into a precise energy blueprint. Learn how it works.", id: "BaZi, or Four Pillars of Destiny, is an ancient Chinese astrology system that maps your birth moment into a precise energy blueprint. Learn how it works." },
