    description: {"en": "Learn how the 10-Year Luck Pillars work in BaZi. Understand which phase of life you are in — building, harvesting, or resting — and what the next decade holds for you.", "zh": "Learn how the 10-Year Luck Pillars work in BaZi. Understand which phase of life you are in — building, harvesting, or resting — and what the next decade holds for you.", "id": "Learn how the 10-Year Luck Pillars work in BaZi. Understand which phase of life you are in — building, harvesting, or resting — and what the next decade holds for you."},
