    description: {"en": "Discover what it means to be a Jia Wood (甲木) Day Master in BaZi — the towering tree — pioneering, upright, growth-driven. Explore your core traits, strengths, blind spots, and how to thrive.", "zh": "Discover what it means to be a Jia Wood (甲木) Day Master in BaZi — the towering tree — pioneering, upright, growth-driven. Explore your core traits, strengths, blind spots, and how to thrive.", "id": "Discover what it means to be a Jia Wood (甲木) Day Master in BaZi — the towering tree — pioneering, upright, growth-driven. Explore your core traits, strengths, blind spots, and how to thrive."},
