    description: {"en": "Discover what it means to be a Yi Wood (乙木) Day Master in BaZi — the climbing vine — adaptable, resilient, diplomatic. Explore your core traits, strengths, blind spots, and how to thrive.", "zh": "Discover what it means to be a Yi Wood (乙木) Day Master in BaZi — the climbing vine — adaptable, resilient, diplomatic. Explore your core traits, strengths, blind spots, and how to thrive.", "id": "Discover what it means to be a Yi Wood (乙木) Day Master in BaZi — the climbing vine — adaptable, resilient, diplomatic. Explore your core traits, strengths, blind spots, and how to thrive."},
