    description: {"en": "Discover what it means to be a Bing Fire (丙火) Day Master in BaZi — the radiant sun — charismatic, generous, impossible to ignore. Explore your core traits, strengths, blind spots, and how to thrive.", "zh": "Discover what it means to be a Bing Fire (丙火) Day Master in BaZi — the radiant sun — charismatic, generous, impossible to ignore. Explore your core traits, strengths, blind spots, and how to thrive.", "id": "Discover what it means to be a Bing Fire (丙火) Day Master in BaZi — the radiant sun — charismatic, generous, impossible to ignore. Explore your core traits, strengths, blind spots, and how to thrive."},
