    description: {"en": "Discover what it means to be a Ding Fire (丁火) Day Master in BaZi — the candle flame — warm, focused, quietly influential. Explore your core traits, strengths, blind spots, and how to thrive.", "zh": "Discover what it means to be a Ding Fire (丁火) Day Master in BaZi — the candle flame — warm, focused, quietly influential. Explore your core traits, strengths, blind spots, and how to thrive.", "id": "Discover what it means to be a Ding Fire (丁火) Day Master in BaZi — the candle flame — warm, focused, quietly influential. Explore your core traits, strengths, blind spots, and how to thrive."},
