    description: {"en": "Discover what it means to be a Wu Earth (戊土) Day Master in BaZi — the mountain — steadfast, reliable, protective. Explore your core traits, strengths, blind spots, and how to thrive.", "zh": "Discover what it means to be a Wu Earth (戊土) Day Master in BaZi — the mountain — steadfast, reliable, protective. Explore your core traits, strengths, blind spots, and how to thrive.", "id": "Discover what it means to be a Wu Earth (戊土) Day Master in BaZi — the mountain — steadfast, reliable, protective. Explore your core traits, strengths, blind spots, and how to thrive."},
