    description: {"en": "Discover what it means to be a Ji Earth (己土) Day Master in BaZi — the fertile field — nurturing, resourceful, accommodating. Explore your core traits, strengths, blind spots, and how to thrive.", "zh": "Discover what it means to be a Ji Earth (己土) Day Master in BaZi — the fertile field — nurturing, resourceful, accommodating. Explore your core traits, strengths, blind spots, and how to thrive.", "id": "Discover what it means to be a Ji Earth (己土) Day Master in BaZi — the fertile field — nurturing, resourceful, accommodating. Explore your core traits, strengths, blind spots, and how to thrive."},
