    description: {"en": "Discover what it means to be a Xin Metal (辛金) Day Master in BaZi — the polished jewel — refined, sensitive, detail-loving. Explore your core traits, strengths, blind spots, and how to thrive.", "zh": "Discover what it means to be a Xin Metal (辛金) Day Master in BaZi — the polished jewel — refined, sensitive, detail-loving. Explore your core traits, strengths, blind spots, and how to thrive.", "id": "Discover what it means to be a Xin Metal (辛金) Day Master in BaZi — the polished jewel — refined, sensitive, detail-loving. Explore your core traits, strengths, blind spots, and how to thrive."},
